  "title": "American Financial Group, Inc. Announces Its Conference Call and Webcast to Discuss 2025 Fourth Quarter and Full Year Results",
  "summary": "CINCINNATI --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jan. 13, 2026-- American Financial Group, Inc. (NYSE: AFG) expects to release its 2025 fourth quarter and full year results after 5:00 p.m. (ET) on Tuesday, February 3, 2026 . The release will be available shortly thereafter on AFG’s website at www.AFGinc.com .",
